const TEXT := """CITY RESCUE PUZZLE PRIVACY POLICY
Last updated: November 19, 2026

City Rescue Puzzle saves level progress, stars, coins, best moves, sound and graphics preferences, selected vehicle colour, and whether ads have been removed. These values are stored in the game's local app storage on your device. City Rescue Puzzle does not run its own account or game data server.

ADS
When advertising is enabled in an Android release build, Google AdMob may serve banner, interstitial, and optional rewarded ads. Once you continue past this notice, AdMob may process device identifiers, IP address, approximate location inferred from IP address, ad views, interactions, and diagnostics under Google's policies. When ads are unavailable or disabled, no ads are shown.

PURCHASES
When Google Play purchases are enabled in a release build, Google Play handles payment and purchase verification for Remove Ads, coin packs, and support purchases. City Rescue Puzzle stores only the resulting game entitlement or coin balance locally; it does not receive your payment card details.

DATA CONTROL
You can erase locally saved game data by clearing the app's storage or uninstalling the game. Google's handling of ad and purchase data follows its own retention and deletion policies. See https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads for Google's advertising information.

CHILDREN
City Rescue Puzzle does not ask players to create an account or enter personal information. Parents and guardians should supervise children's use of ads and purchases.

CHANGES AND CONTACT
We may revise this notice as game features change. For privacy questions or support, contact muhammadfaysal.khan7@gmail.com.

This notice explains data use. It is not a choice about personalized advertising."""
